# .github/CODEOWNERS
# Mandatory review routing for LedgerLens security-sensitive paths

# Smart Contracts & Domain Logic
# (last matching pattern wins; the catch-all covers every contract crate, incl.
# reference-provider and the mocks, so a new crate is never unowned)
/contracts/                          @LedgerLens/arch-reviewers
/contracts/ledgerlens-score/src/    @LedgerLens/arch-reviewers
/contracts/ledgerlens-aggregator/src/ @LedgerLens/arch-reviewers

# Documentation & Specifications
/docs/                               @LedgerLens/arch-reviewers
/spec/                               @LedgerLens/arch-reviewers
/SECURITY.md                         @LedgerLens/arch-reviewers

# Build Configuration & Tooling
/Cargo.toml                          @LedgerLens/arch-reviewers
/Cargo.lock                          @LedgerLens/arch-reviewers
/deny.toml                           @LedgerLens/arch-reviewers
/rust-toolchain.toml                 @LedgerLens/arch-reviewers
/toolchain-versions.json             @LedgerLens/arch-reviewers
/schemas/                            @LedgerLens/arch-reviewers
/fuzz/                               @LedgerLens/arch-reviewers

# CI, release engineering and the coverage / test-tier gates. Changes to the
# coverage exclusion list or thresholds must be reviewed here (docs/coverage.md).
/.github/                            @LedgerLens/arch-reviewers
/coverage-thresholds.toml            @LedgerLens/arch-reviewers
/test-tiers.toml                     @LedgerLens/arch-reviewers
/tools/                              @LedgerLens/arch-reviewers

# Operational & Deployment Scripts
# Gate production (canary-deploy, rollback, key-rotation rehearsal) and encrypted mainnet manifests
/scripts/                            @LedgerLens/arch-reviewers
/deploy/                             @LedgerLens/arch-reviewers
/deploy.sh                           @LedgerLens/arch-reviewers

# Reference & Integration Tests
/examples/                           @LedgerLens/arch-reviewers
/tests/                              @LedgerLens/arch-reviewers
